  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the Online Application Module (OAM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to continually ensure the functionality of the Online Applicaton Module for all users of the platform after the initiation of the collaboration between IOM and BAMF in 2024, IOM Germany will carry out activities such as user support, user trainings, gathering of development requirements, software development as well as testing of newly implemented changes, and coordinate these with the external and internal users.</narrative>
  </description>
